              "text": "tiānqì nuǎnhuo le xuěrén dōu rónghuà le — It turned warm, and the snowmen all melted."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Its characters come later; for now it is a word for the ear."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
